 "metaDescription": "Access, share and instantly verify government-issued documents, certificates, driving licences, vehicle registration certificates, marksheets and more with DigiLocker, India's trusted digital document platform.",
 "text": "Government of India\n\nSkip to main content | A+ A A- |  English\nExplore DigiLocker\nBecome a Partner\nLogin / Register\nNew in DigiLocker\n\nRegistered Deed\n\nDeputy Commissioner South Andaman\nAvailable Now\n\nGPF Annual Statement, Salary Slip\n\nPrincipal Accountant General (A and E), Assam\nAvailable Now\n\nGPF Annual Statement, Salary Slip\n\nPrincipal Accountant General (A&E), Manipur\nAvailable Now\n\nVarious e-Services\n\nDirectorate of Urban Administration and Development Govt. of MP\nAvailable Now\n\nRegistered Deed\n\nSub Registrar DD & DNH\nAvailable Now\n\nIntegrated Certificate\n\nMA & UD Department, Government of Andhra Pradesh\nAvailable Now\n\nRegistered Deed\n\nDeputy Commissioner South Andaman\nAvailable Now\n\nGPF Annual Statement, Salary Slip\n\nPrincipal Accountant General (A and E), Assam\nAvailable Now\n\nGPF Annual Statement, Salary Slip\n\nPrincipal Accountant General (A&E), Manipur\nAvailable Now\n\nVarious e-Services\n\nDirectorate of Urban Administration and Development Govt. of MP\nAvailable Now\n\nRegistered Deed\n\nSub Registrar DD & DNH\nAvailable Now\n\nIntegrated Certificate\n\nMA & UD Department, Government of Andhra Pradesh\nAvailable Now\n\nRegistered Deed\n\nDeputy Commissioner South Andaman\nAvailable Now\n\nGPF Annual Statement, Salary Slip\n\nPrincipal Accountant General (A and E), Assam\nAvailable Now\n‹\n›\nTrending Now\nAPAAR ID\nClass X Marksheet\nDegree Certificate\nClass XII Marksheet\nPAN Card\n\nExplore\n\nDocuments by Categories\nIdentity Documents\nEducation and Learning\nHealth and Wellness\nTransport & Infrastructure\nGovernment & Public Sector\nSkill & Vocational Training\nIndustry & Private Sector\nSports & Culture\nMore Categories\nExplore Documents by State\nView All\nKarnataka\n\n200+ Issuers\n\nKerala\n\n95+ Issuers\n\nMaharashtra\n\n300+ Issuers\n\nOdisha\n\n65+ Issuers\n\nRajasthan\n\n125+ Issuers\n\nAssam\n\n50+ Issuers\n\nBihar\n\n45+ Issuers\n\nDelhi\n\n110+ Issuers\n\nGujarat\n\n110+ Issuers\n\nKarnataka\n\n200+ Issuers\n\nKerala\n\n95+ Issuers\n\nMaharashtra\n\n300+ Issuers\n\nOdisha\n\n65+ Issuers\n\nRajasthan\n\n125+ Issuers\n\nAssam\n\n50+ Issuers\n\nBihar\n\n45+ Issuers\n\nDelhi\n\n110+ Issuers\n\nGujarat\n\n110+ Issuers\n\nKarnataka\n\n200+ Issuers\n\n‹\n›\n\nABOUT DIGILOCKER\n\nDocument Wallet to Empower Citizens\n\nDigiLocker is a flagship initiative of Ministry of Electronics & IT (MeitY) under Digital India programme. DigiLocker aims at 'Digital Empowerment' of citizen by providing access to authentic digital documents to citizen's digital document wallet. DigiLocker is a secure cloud based platform for storage, sharing and verification of documents & certificates.\n\nMore about DigiLocker\nView Statistics\n70+ Crore\n\nRegistered Users\n\n900+ Crore\n\nIssued Documents\n\nGetting started is quick and easy\nRegister yourself\nVerify yourself\nFetch your documents\nShare your documents\nBecome a DigiLocker Partner Organization\n\nGet registered as a DigiLocker Issuer or Requester!\n\nGET REGISTERED\nDownload DigiLocker App\n\nDigiLocker aims at 'Digital Empowerment' by providing access to authentic digital documents to the citizen's digital document wallet.\n\nFOLLOW US\nHome\nAbout Us\nFAQ\nStatistics\nResources\nCirculars\nExplore DigiLocker\nSupport/Feedback\nTerms & Condition Of Use\nInformational Videos\nCredits\nPartners\nMeriPehchaan\nPartner FAQ\n\nPowered by\n\nNational e-Governance Division (NeGD)\n\nDigital India Corporation\n\nMinistry of Electronics & IT (MeitY)\n\nGovernment of India\n\nDOWNLOAD APP\n\nLast Updated: Oct 12, 2026\n\nCopyright© 2026, Website maintained by National e-Governance Division (NeGD) \nDigiLocker Policy\nContact Us\n \n ",
